  "status": "present",
  "value": "Words are maximal runs of ASCII letters and digits, compared case-insensitively. A description indicates a studio if it has the word 'studio'; it indicates one bedroom if it has the word '1br' or '1bd', or the word '1' or 'one' immediately followed by the word 'bedroom'. If exactly one kind is indicated, the corrected count is 0 (studio) or 1; otherwise the recorded count is kept. Return the corrected array (all keyword rules inferred).",
